# A note whose text contains a tab character shows the words apart, not glued together.
# BUG: the tab inside the text is drawn as nothing, so "Some note<TAB>with tab" reads "Some notewith tab".
file <<END
Notes:
	Some note	with tab
END
see Some note
hide Some notewith tab
quit
saved <<END
Notes:
	Some note	with tab
END
